Dear ..........,', 'Tone: semi-formal, polite but personal, to someone you know in a formal relationship. Use their title and surname, state your purpose early, and close with "Yours sincerely" and your full name. Cover all three bullet points and develop each one with relevant detail; a missing bullet point limits Task Achievement. Make the purpose of the letter clear, organise it into paragraphs, and keep the tone consistent throughout. There is no single correct letter.', 0, 1200, 20, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Writing', 'Task 1', 'General Training', 'Semi-formal']),
('ielts-gt-letter-007', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'writing', 'ielts-writing-task1-letter', 'Write a letter', 'A broken heating system', 'You should spend about 20 minutes on this task.

