('ielts-gt-letter-008', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'writing', 'ielts-writing-task1-letter', 'Write a letter', 'A teacher who is retiring', 'You should spend about 20 minutes on this task.

